      "ruling": "Matt 2026-09-20: finish the EoR Warlord across all directions. W1 idle = RESTING idle only (no second idle for now). W2 attack = the Eye of Reckoning SPIN, looping, and attach the EoR whirlwind VFX already built in the Godot 3D work — the spin rate of the attack clip must match that VFX. W3 cast = shield-forward slam/thrust, projectile from the mace head (the socket). W4 resting idle as the Keeper had (at ease, breath). W5 include run. W6 order: walk + run first, then attack, then cast, then jump (conductor slots the resting idle after run). Seeds: 5 Grok stills from one reference (S r1; SW, E, NE, N) — probe-grade seeds promoted to this lap seeds; W/SW-mirror… mirrors W←E, SE←SW, NW←NE (F17a). Register: a LAP DECISION in the pixel-overworld regime — recognition record owed; style-register.md stays locked pending canon. Grok budget: ~35 clips at 5 unique × 7; weekly cap = the HALT. Astra: still dark (T25) — exporter states beyond idle/walk/run/jump/cast (the attack state) need a TOOLING extension when Codex returns; attack cells are staged meanwhile.",
