      "topic": "Wave 2 eye read; E/NE run facing drift — second failure → best candidate FLAGGED",
      "ruling": "Idles S/SW/E/NE/N: PASS by eye — steady, size flat (g1 pending), mace grounded beside the boot, shield lowered, elevated view intact; cut at the prompted 2-s breath after --min-start-s 1.5. E_run_r1: facing drift AGAIN (three-quarter toward the camera mid-clip); NE_run_r1: wobbles toward E with the mace raised. Second failure on both → charter § 2 fallback: the best candidate ships FLAGGED (r1 for both — facing holds longer at the start; v1 kept). FINDING for the packet: Grok holds facing on walks (5/5) but not on fast side/back-quarter runs (2/5 fail twice) in this regime. No third spend.",
